{"kind": "mod", "id": 1155, "name": "LootValue", "slug": "lootvalue", "teaser": "Show sell price in tooltip.\r\nQuick sell with Left Alt + Left Shift + Left Click.", "owner_name": "IhanaMies", "downloads": 209121, "favourites": 2, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:51.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-11-10T05:25:52.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-11-10T05:25:52.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "5.0.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Please report any errors/problems this mod might cause.</p>\n<p>Adds selectable quick sell functionality, one button (left click) or two button (left and right click)</p>\n<p>One button variation: Left Alt + Left Shift + Left Click (traders/flea)</p>\n<p>Two button variation: Left Alt + Left Shift + Left Click (traders) / Right Click (flea)</p>\n<p>One button quick sell functionality sells either to a trader, or flea, which ever has better value.</p>\n<p>Show the <strong>exact</strong> sell value of an item in tooltip when hovering mouse over.</p>\n<p>Coloured price is value per slot followed by total value, if the item is more than 1 slot.</p>\n<p>Better price is highlighted (trader or flea).</p>\n<p>Colour grading by value (rubles) per slot:</p>\n<p>&lt; 5000</p>\n<p>&lt; 7500</p>\n<p>&lt; 10000</p>\n<p>&lt; 15000</p>\n<p>&lt; 20000</p>\n<p>&gt; 20000</p>\n<p>Color gradings are customizable.</p>\n<p>Huge thanks for the mods Eyes of a Trader by Platinum and ItemSellPrice by IcyClawz for the idea and learning (stealing) the most important pieces of code.<br />\nThanks to sixGdie for helping to upgrade for 3.10</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1577, "published_at": "2024-04-02T18:57:38.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1155/lootvalue/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3214, "published_at": "2024-07-07T17:01:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1155/lootvalue/3.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.2", "content_length": null, "downloads": 762, "published_at": "2024-07-19T14:20:16.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1155/lootvalue/3.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "4.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 40019, "published_at": "2024-12-06T16:25:54.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1155/lootvalue/4.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "5.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 705, "published_at": "2025-04-08T13:44:19.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1155/lootvalue/5.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "5.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 64182, "published_at": "2025-04-09T13:26:16.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1155/lootvalue/5.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["IhanaMies/LootValue"], "source_